PN,36201
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F362A1790848098
OL,3,CCity used 'sham' contracts to 'reduce
OL,4,Ccosts by more than #900m'
OL,6,FManchester City arranged 'sham'
OL,7,Fcontracts and relied on 'sham'
OL,8,Fagreements to 'artificially inflate'
OL,9,Ftheir revenues and reduce costs by
OL,10,F#900million, the Premier League has
OL,11,Ffound.
OL,13,FThe club were found guilty of all
OL,14,Fcharges related to breaches of Premier
OL,15,FLeague financial rules between 2009-10
OL,16,Fand 2017-18 by an independent
OL,17,Fcommission, the league has said.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,363,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F362A1790848098
OL,3,CCity used 'sham' contracts to 'reduce
OL,4,Ccosts by more than #900m'
OL,6,FThe Premier League said the
OL,7,Findependent commission found City
OL,8,Farranged 'sham' commercial deals with
OL,9,Fa number of its sponsors during the
OL,10,Fperiod, which were part of a disguised
OL,11,Ffunding scheme, whereby those
OL,12,Fcompanies were only required to pay a
OL,13,Fportion of the relevant sponsorship
OL,14,Ffees.
OL,16,FThe commission found that the
OL,17,Fremainder was funded by Abu Dhabi
OL,18,FUnited Group Investment & Development
OL,19,FLtd (ADUG), which owned the club.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,363,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F362A1790848098
OL,3,CCity used 'sham' contracts to 'reduce
OL,4,Ccosts by more than #900m'
OL,6,FThe league said that now the charges
OL,7,Fhave been proved, the issue of
OL,8,Fsanction will be addressed separately
OL,9,Fin a further hearing with the
OL,10,Findependent commission.
OL,12,FThe club has the right to appeal the
OL,13,Findependent commission's findings, and
OL,14,Fhas until October 2 to exercise that
OL,15,Fright.
OL,17,FRichard Masters, the Chief Executive
OL,18,Fof the Premier League, called the case
OL,19,Fand decision "the most significant in
OL,20,FPremier League history".
OL,26,@{D@NOU|D@WO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,363,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F362A1790848098
OL,3,CCity used 'sham' contracts to 'reduce
OL,4,Ccosts by more than #900m'
OL,6,FFurther "sham arrangements" the club
OL,7,Fwere found to have entered into
OL,8,Fenabled the club to record lower
OL,9,Foperating expenses than they actually
OL,10,Fincurred, the Premier League's
OL,11,Fpublished statement said.
OL,13,FThe scheme was found to have inflated
OL,14,Fthe club's revenues and reduced their
OL,15,Fcosts by more than #900million during
OL,16,Fthe affected period.
OL,26,@nD@IOUnD@[O]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,363,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F362A1790848098
OL,3,CCity used 'sham' contracts to 'reduce
OL,4,Ccosts by more than #900m'
OL,6,FThe commission found the club had
OL,7,Ftherefore filed misstated accounts and
OL,8,Fconcealed the true state of its
OL,9,Ffinances from its auditors and
OL,10,Ffootball regulators.
OL,12,FThe commission concluded that "by its
OL,13,Fconduct the club clearly intended to
OL,14,Fcircumvent the Premier League rules."
OL,16,FWhat did the club do?
OL,18,FWhat was found in the report?
OL,26,@tD@_OUvD@eO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,363,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F362A1790848098
OL,3,CCity used 'sham' contracts to 'reduce
OL,4,Ccosts by more than #900m'
OL,6,FThe commission found that had
OL,7,Finformation been accurately reported,
OL,8,Fthe club would have been in breach of
OL,9,FPremier League and UEFA spending
OL,10,Flimits "by a very large amount".
OL,12,FThe club were also found to have
OL,13,Fcommitted multiple breaches of their
OL,14,Fduty to co-operate with the
OL,15,Finvestigation, and tried to "stop and
OL,16,Ffrustrate" the Premier League's
OL,17,Finvestigation, which began in 2018.
OL,26,@rD@HOUrD@_O]wD@]OUxD@JO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,363,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F362A1790848098
OL,3,CCity used 'sham' contracts to 'reduce
OL,4,Ccosts by more than #900m'
OL,6,FMasters said: "The core decision
OL,7,Festablishes the facts of what happened
OL,8,Fat Manchester City during this period.
OL,9,FIt details how the club systematically
OL,10,Fbroke Premier League rules for nearly
OL,11,Fa decade.
OL,13,F"It also vindicates the Premier
OL,14,FLeague's decision to pursue this case
OL,15,Fagainst Manchester City. While the
OL,16,Fprocess to date has been both long and
OL,17,Fdifficult, the league has remained
OL,18,Fdetermined that the facts be
OL,19,Festablished independently.
OL,26,@nD@OOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,363,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F362A1790848098
OL,3,CCity used 'sham' contracts to 'reduce
OL,4,Ccosts by more than #900m'
OL,6,F"It is a key responsibility of the
OL,7,FPremier League to ensure that the
OL,8,Frules, approved by the clubs
OL,9,Fthemselves, are upheld to protect the
OL,10,Fintegrity of the competition. It is
OL,11,Fparamount that the league remains
OL,12,Fcompetitive and fair for all clubs and
OL,13,Ffor the fans. We take that role
OL,14,Fextremely seriously."
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@UO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,363,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F362A1790848098
OL,3,CCity used 'sham' contracts to 'reduce
OL,4,Ccosts by more than #900m'
OL,6,FMasters added: "This disciplinary
OL,7,Fcase, and this decision, are the most
OL,8,Fsignificant in Premier League history.
OL,9,FThere are elements of the case that
OL,10,Fremain to be decided, including,
OL,11,Fimportantly, what sanction must follow
OL,12,Ffor these breaches. Now we have the
OL,13,FCommission's decision, we are
OL,14,Fcommitted to moving swiftly through
OL,15,Fthe remainder of the process, to
OL,16,Fprovide certainty for the league, our
OL,17,Fclubs and fans."
OL,26,@nD@POU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,363,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36210
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F362A1790848098
OL,3,CCity used 'sham' contracts to 'reduce
OL,4,Ccosts by more than #900m'
OL,6,FResponding to the news, Manchester
OL,7,FCity said it was "both disappointed
OL,8,Fand surprised by the opinion of the
OL,9,FPremier League Commission".
OL,11,FThey added they will now pursue an
OL,12,Fappeal "on the basis that the opinion
OL,13,Fcontains clear material errors, of
OL,14,Flaw, principle and fact, and is
OL,15,Funsafe."
OL,26,@tD@HOUwD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,363,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36211
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F362A1790848098
OL,3,CCity used 'sham' contracts to 'reduce
OL,4,Ccosts by more than #900m'
OL,6,FIn a statement, it said: "The Club is
OL,7,Finnocent of the accusations made by
OL,8,Fthe Premier League and a comprehensive
OL,9,Fbody of irrefutable evidence exists in
OL,10,Fsupport of all of its positions,
OL,11,Frelating to this case.
OL,13,F"The Club will therefore be
OL,14,Frelentless, and where necessary
OL,15,Fproactive, in any and all appropriate
OL,16,Fregulatory and legal forums.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G11/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,363,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36212
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F362A1790848098
OL,3,CCity used 'sham' contracts to 'reduce
OL,4,Ccosts by more than #900m'
OL,6,F"The Premier League process remains
OL,7,Fongoing, with significant elements
OL,8,Funcompleted. Manchester City FC will
OL,9,Fnow pursue the appeal avenues open to
OL,10,Fit, on the basis that the opinion
OL,11,Fcontains clear material errors, of
OL,12,Flaw, principle and fact, and is unsafe.
OL,14,F"The Club has diligently respected due
OL,15,Fprocess for eight years on the basis
OL,16,Fthat the Premier League Board and
OL,17,FExecutive would behave as an
OL,18,Findependent, impartial and fair-minded
OL,19,Fregulator, free from partisan
OL,20,Finfluence.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G12/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,363,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36213
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F362A1790848098
OL,3,CCity used 'sham' contracts to 'reduce
OL,4,Ccosts by more than #900m'
OL,6,F"The Club is obviously restricted in
OL,7,Fwhat it can say further until all
OL,8,Ffuture proceedings are complete."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G13/13
